{"parse": {"title": "太阳的背面-01", "pageid": 84867, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%83%E7%AC%83%E9%AA%A8%C2%B7%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%8C%E9%9D%A2\" title=\"笃笃骨·太阳的背面\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">太阳的背面-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%8C%E9%9D%A2-02\" title=\"太阳的背面-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">太阳的背面</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.9C.97.E7.89.9B.E8.A1.8C.E8.BF.B9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"蜗牛行迹\">蜗牛行迹</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 蜗牛行迹</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Slithering Snails</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2350101</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>今天还好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>……不好，我的腿还是很酸痛……也许是拉伸过度了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>夏洛特，我再给你5分钟热身，别找借口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>5分钟……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>如果你想，我也可以放你一个永无止境的长假。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她脸上再次出现了近似讥嘲的笑容——年幼的女孩再也忍不住了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我完全是按照编排做的动作……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>既然你照着我的话做了，为什么还要在这里进行这些无意义的反驳？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>夏洛特，怎么不说话？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>你还是离不开你那可笑的自尊心吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>好了，我不想听理由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>教练不耐烦地挥了挥手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>再来一次——别让我觉得你是个废物，夏洛特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苛刻的女人打开了钢线录音机，音乐刺入了女孩的耳膜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年幼的体操运动员深吸一口气。当她抬起头时，一个笑容正挂在她的脸上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>音乐进行着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>手抬高！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她连忙把手递得更高。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>踢腿！幅度不够！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她绷直脚尖，把腿送得更远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>客观、中肯的评价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的心头一松，随即开始下一个动作——这是“自由祭祀”最为关键的一环。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>选手需要将对神秘术的理解融入到表演效果中，达到躯体、思想、情感与神秘术四者的合一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对参赛者来说，这也是最为困难的一环。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>不对——你的神秘术呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>停下！停下！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>愤怒的教练员喝止了这次训练，她望向女孩，视线冷得像一块冰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>你又忘记动作了，夏洛特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我没有——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>你为什么没有把动作连接起来？为什么在这么关键的时候犹豫？！这动作至少值1.2分！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>你知道1.2分意味着什么吗？1.2分足够让你掉下三个名次！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>严苛的女人长长地舒出一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>你真是个废物，夏洛特。我对你太失望了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>但是我之前的动作都很准确，上一个教练告诉过我，我的动作是最标准的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前的女人发出了一声嗤笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>那这丢失的1.2分，你要从哪里找回来？从前教练的嘴里吗？小姑娘，赛制不会因为你用不出这个神秘术而修改。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>别自大，夏洛特，我见过别的“自由祭祀”选手。她们每一个的神秘术都比你用得更生动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教练：</div><div>好好想想吧……你是得想想了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女人近似于呢喃地说道。随后，她深深地叹了一口气，离开了训练室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>我绝不是废物……！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_fangjian\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_fangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一段糟糕的噩梦，她暗暗地咬了咬牙齿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>墙上的时钟已经走向了7点——快到那个约定的时间了。沉默的女巫为自己装上假肢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在器械长年的压迫下，肢体的残端总是有着微微的肿胀。随着她的动作，假肢咯吱咯吱的响声回荡在寂静的室内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>叮铃铃——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>该死的！在这种时候……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>迫于亟待处理的事物，女巫未经检视地扣上了皮质束带。<br />然而这脆弱的连结在她起身的那一刻乍然断裂，使她整个身体重重地坠向地面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-310520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-310520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-310520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>女巫小姐！屋子里有好大的响声！你摔倒了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>遥远的声音自门扉之外传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-310520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-310520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-310520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>女巫小姐，请问可以给我开门吗？蜗牛要爬到我的手上了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>见鬼——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她顾不上那支假肢了，整个人跌跌撞撞地摔在了门框上。随后，她一脸阴沉地打开了门。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_at_dudugu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_at_dudugu1\"><img alt=\"2_3_at_dudugu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-2_3_at_dudugu1.png/600px-Cg-2_3_at_dudugu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-2_3_at_dudugu1.png/900px-Cg-2_3_at_dudugu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-2_3_at_dudugu1.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_at_dudugu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>来啦，女巫小姐……这是这周的蜗牛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>你还好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>——别问这些，把蜗牛给我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩眨了眨眼睛，随后将那只铁皮桶递到了女巫的鼻子下方，里面装满了蜗牛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>去门口的邮筒，拿你这周的报酬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>我可以换一种报酬吗，女巫小姐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>我想知道，你每天都在屋子里做些什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>汤普顿说这个屋子里每天都有怪声响，就像一百只青蛙同时在叫唤——这是你的神秘术吗？你为什么拥有这样的神秘术？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>女巫小姐，你可以告诉我，我要怎样才能——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>滚出我的院子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>诶？可是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>你没听清楚吗？我让你——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_at_dudugu2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_at_dudugu2_zone\"><img alt=\"2_3_at_dudugu2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-2_3_at_dudugu2_zone.png/600px-Cg-2_3_at_dudugu2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"545\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-2_3_at_dudugu2_zone.png/900px-Cg-2_3_at_dudugu2_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/0a/Cg-2_3_at_dudugu2_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1188\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:166%\">出去！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话音未落，眼前的门“砰”地一声关上了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "太阳的背面-01"}}